### 1. Login og gem token automatisk
POST http://localhost:7070/api/v1/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "admin@test.dk",
  "password": "FIND PASSWORD I NOTER"
}

> {%
    client.global.set("auth_token", response.body.token);
%}

### 2. Gem note med Authorization-header
POST http://localhost:7070/api/v1/notes/save
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{auth_token}}

{
  "text": "Seal - sæl eller segl?",
  "userId": 1
}


### Hent alle gemte noter fra bruger
GET http://localhost:7070/api/v1/notes/user/6
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{auth_token}}